  "name": "mount",
  "description": "A mounting middleware for the Iron web framework that enables hierarchical request routing. It utilizes a prefix-based Trie structure to dispatch requests to handlers while rewriting request paths to be relative to the mount point. The implementation preserves the original URL context within the request extensions for downstream middleware access.",
